1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
Where did you go last night?
Tối qua bạn đã đi đâu?

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,879
I went to a party.
Mình đã đi dự tiệc.

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:07,960
Who did you go with?
Bạn đi với ai?

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,640
I went with my cousin.
Mình đi với anh/chị họ.

5
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,240
What did you eat?
Bạn đã ăn gì?

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,660
I ate some cake.
Mình đã ăn bánh.

7
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,519
What did you drink?
Bạn đã uống gì?

8
00:00:16,519 --> 00:00:18,760
I drank some orange juice.
Mình đã uống nước cam.

9
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,080
I wish there was a party every day.
Ước gì ngày nào cũng có tiệc.
